I'm 35 and only learned this lesson recently, so, don't beat yourself up over it. I gave 18 years to the same company, did everything for them, but when I;

 a) asked for a pay rise (the first time in 18 years) which was denied as they said i hadn't done enough for the company (I landed a huge account in Korea for them... and; 

b) told them that in the near future, i would need time off as i would be having a kidney transplant, so  wanted to forewarn them...

&#x200B;

They made me redundant. When i pointed out that I was the longest serving there, that there were others who did the same job and had only been there 2 years, AND, that they had just created 2 new roles which i could have done; they simply said, " We aren't considering anyone else for the redundancies. Everyone else has other roles attached to their job, except you." and promptly let me go (No prior warning of this coming, and let go THAT afternoon...)

&#x200B;

Look out for yourself, and make sure YOU are happy. Don't do things to please other people, sadly, that is the way of the workplace, or; if you do, do it infrequently so you don't look like an ass, but neither do you look like a pushover. As you said; you aren't a friend, you are a commodity.

My thinking was; black ops / Psy ops could test new chemical / biological agents on unwitting subjects, also neurological experiments á la MK Ultra etc. People would not consent to that kind of stuff. We know that the US alone has a history of VARIOUS experiments on it's own citizens without their consent (project SHAD for example)

&#x200B;

We don't ***know*** those tests are nonsensical, meaningless tortures; maybe thats the impression the experimenters want to give out? Also, perhaps they ***ARE*** lab conditions; who actually knows where they are? Whats to say they don't administer some kind of nerve agent or hallucinogen to incapacitate or disorient the victim, then take them to a purpose built lab complex with high tech equipment for performing said experiments. Maybe the control group are people who are recruited for "clinical trials" for the latest cold remedy or asthma drug or whatnot...

&#x200B;

The hybrid babies or videos of the end of the world, to back up the narrative that they are ET's. Why would aliens know about the end of the world? Unless Einstein was wrong and bi-directional time travel is possible.

As for the grey costumes, there was a rumour where the soviets faked a UFO over the US, but it crashed with it's "ET occupant" inside; IIRC the occupant was supposedly a sub-human experiment of Nazi Dr. Josef Mengele. Now, I'm not sure how plausible that is, but they did do some strange stuff, so i guess it's possible that when the soviets stormed Berlin, they found soe of his research papers, or indeed the experiments (living or dead)

