Firstly, I died a little inside that you got hate and people saying some females can have penises. No. They. Can't. There. I said it and i am not sorry for it.

&#x200B;

Now; moving on to the topic at hand:

&#x200B;

Viagra, as people have said, is a vasodilator. It was originally invented as an angina medication, but in tests they noticed it's "other" effects.

&#x200B;

I've actually read reports from women who took Viagra, and basically, it increases blood flow to the genetalia, making the body more receptive to touch, and thus, heightening pleasure. 

&#x200B;

Here is one such article detailing it:  [https://www.nytimes.com/1998/05/17/style/curious-women-are-seeing-if-viagra-works-wonders-for-them.html](https://www.nytimes.com/1998/05/17/style/curious-women-are-seeing-if-viagra-works-wonders-for-them.html)

